 llvm/lib/Target/RISCV/RISCVISelDAGToDAG.cpp | 52 +---------------
 llvm/test/CodeGen/RISCV/rv64zba.ll          | 66 ---------------------
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 116 deletions(-)

